# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Python toolkit for randomization-based quantum noise characterization.\n"
msgstr "Toolkit Python untuk karakterisasi noise kuantum berbasis randomisasi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Note\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  **Alpha software.** This library is in the `0.x` stage of development and under active development. No part of the public interface is yet stable: while the major version is `0`, expect breaking changes between releases and pin your dependency accordingly (for example, `qiskit-noise-learning==0.1.*`). We do not currently issue deprecation warnings, but all changes are recorded in the [release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/release-notes). See the [deprecation policy](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-noise-learning/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md) for details. All feedback is appreciated.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Catatan\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  **Software alpha.** Library ini berada di tahap pengembangan `0.x` dan masih aktif dikembangkan. Belum ada bagian antarmuka publik yang stabil: selama versi mayornya `0`, bersiaplah menghadapi perubahan yang merusak (breaking changes) antar rilis dan pin dependensimu sesuai itu (misalnya, `qiskit-noise-learning==0.1.*`). Saat ini kami tidak mengeluarkan peringatan deprecation, tetapi semua perubahan dicatat di [catatan rilis](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/release-notes). Lihat [kebijakan deprecation](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-noise-learning/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md) untuk detailnya. Semua masukan kami hargai.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Interfaces and Documentation {#interfaces-and-documentation}"
msgstr "Antarmuka dan Dokumentasi {#interfaces-and-documentation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This library has two levels of interface. The first is the low-level interface where the user directly interacts with objects representing core concepts in noise learning, enabling custom design of every aspect of a noise learning protocol. The second is a higher-level interface, the `qiskit_noise_learning.protocols` subpackage, which holds one pair of functions per protocol – `prepare_vanilla_program` and `process_vanilla_result` for the standard “vanilla” protocol – each pair wrapping a stock workflow into a single call on either side of execution.\n"
msgstr "Library ini punya dua level antarmuka. Yang pertama adalah antarmuka tingkat rendah, tempat pengguna berinteraksi langsung dengan objek yang mewakili konsep inti dalam noise learning, sehingga setiap aspek protokol noise learning bisa dirancang sendiri. Yang kedua adalah antarmuka tingkat lebih tinggi, yaitu subpaket `qiskit_noise_learning.protocols`, yang menyimpan sepasang fungsi untuk setiap protokol – `prepare_vanilla_program` dan `process_vanilla_result` untuk protokol “vanilla” standar – tiap pasangan membungkus satu alur kerja siap pakai menjadi satu pemanggilan di kedua sisi eksekusi.\n"

